</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/01adced2-748e-11f1-b640-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/Solaire.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/01adced2-748e-11f1-b640-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/Solaire.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">c3051bee-7493-11f1-aa35-576ed39421ff</guid><pubDate>Tue, 30 Jun 2026 14:56:01 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/01adced2-748e-11f1-b640-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/Solaire.jpg">© France 24</source><dc:creator>罗拉</dc:creator></item><item><category>欧洲</category><title>欧盟对价值低于150欧元的小包裹征收3欧元关税 周三起实施</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E6%AC%A7%E6%B4%B2/20260630-%E6%AC%A7%E7%9B%9F%E5%AF%B9%E4%BB%B7%E5%80%BC%E4%BD%8E%E4%BA%8E150%E6%AC%A7%E5%85%83%E7%9A%84%E5%B0%8F%E5%8C%85%E8%A3%B9%E5%BE%81%E6%94%B63%E6%AC%A7%E5%85%83%E5%85%B3%E7%A8%8E-%E5%91%A8%E4%B8%89%E8%B5%B7%E5%AE%9E%E6%96%BD</link><description>
